RealRoots -- Package for exploring, counting and locating real solutions to polynomial systems
**********************************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package provides general tools for elimination and solving systems of
polynomial equations, with a particular emphasis on real solutions.

Acknowledgement
===============

This package is an updated version the realroots package by Grayson and
Sottile.

