sylvesterCount -- a signed count of the real roots of a univariate polynomial with rational coefficients
********************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        sylvesterCount(f,g,a,b)
        sylvesterCount(f,g)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a univariate
        polynomial with rational coefficients
      * g, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, a univariate
        polynomial with rational coefficients in the same variable as f
      * a, a *note rational number: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,, (optional) the left
        endpoint of the interval
      * b, a *note rational number: (Macaulay2Doc)QQ,, (optional) the right
        endpoint of the interval
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note Multiplicity: Multiplicity_lpRealRoots_rp, => ..., default value
        false, option for computing roots with multiplicity
  * Outputs:
      * an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the difference between the number
        of real roots of f in the interval $(a,b]$ where g is positive, and the
        number of real roots of f in the interval $[a,b)$ where g is negative

Description
===========

This computes the difference between the number of real roots of  f in the
interval $(a,b]$ where g is positive, and the number of real roots of f in the
interval $[a,b)$ where g is negative. This is computed by taking the difference
in variations of the reduced Sylvester sequence of f and g.

+--------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[t]                  |
|                                |
|o1 = R                          |
|                                |
|o1 : PolynomialRing             |
+--------------------------------+
|i2 : f = (t - 2)*(t - 1)*(t + 3)|
|                                |
|      3                         |
|o2 = t  - 7t + 6                |
|                                |
|o2 : R                          |
+--------------------------------+
|i3 : g = t + 1                  |
|                                |
|o3 = t + 1                      |
|                                |
|o3 : R                          |
+--------------------------------+
|i4 : a = -5                     |
|                                |
|o4 = -5                         |
+--------------------------------+
|i5 : b = 4                      |
|                                |
|o5 = 4                          |
+--------------------------------+
|i6 : sylvesterCount(f,g,a,b)    |
|                                |
|o6 = 1                          |
+--------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note sylvesterSequence: sylvesterSequence, -- the Sylvester sequence of
    two univariate polynomials with rational coefficients
  * *note sturmCount: sturmCount, -- the number of real roots of a univariate
    polynomial with rational coefficients

